            sampled from :math:`\mathcal{U}(-\sqrt{k}, \sqrt{k})` where
            :math:`k = \frac{groups}{C_\text{in} * \text{kernel\_size}}`

    Examples::

        >>> m = nn.Conv1d(16, 33, 3, stride=2)
        >>> input = torch.randn(20, 16, 50)
        >>> output = m(input)

